---
import "@styles/global.module.css";
import Header from "@components/header.astro";
import Footer from "@components/footer.astro";
import Meta from "@components/meta.astro";
import Cursor from "@components/cursor.astro";
import Scripts from "@components/scripts.astro";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <Meta name="Why I returned to MSC modding" description="About why I returned to My Summer Car modding" />
        <Scripts />
        <Cursor />
    </head>

    <body>
        <canvas id="background"></canvas>
        <!-- God damnit, I'm forced to use inline styles because Astro is stupid -->
        <div style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;">
            <Header />
            <main>
                <h1>Why I returned to My Summer Car modding</h1>

                <p>
                    After countless DM's on NexusMods, pings on Discord servers, e-mails and other ways to contact me, I am finally returning back to My Summer Car modding. After a brief poll on fedi, the choice of returning is final.
                </p>
                <p>My mods are now back up on NexusMods, including Lunya's Mini Mods (formerly MSC Tweaks), Legacy MSC (formerly GoodOldMSC) and Pride Mod. These mods will continue receiving updates to fix bugs and to get new features.</p>
                <p>
                    While the community is toxic, I was able to miss most of the toxic comments by having comments off for the first 5 days, although a <a href="/guestbook">side effect of this</a> can be seen by people searching for other ways
                    to contact me.
                </p>
                <p>What I will do now is keep updating my mods, scroll past toxic comments or just reply to them with generic responses, and keep updating my mods! Hopefully this will go great.</p>
                <p>You can download any of these 3 mods below:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><a href="https://www.nexusmods.com/mysummercar/mods/8944">Lunya's Mini Mods</a></li>
                    <li><a href="https://www.nexusmods.com/mysummercar/mods/8947">Legacy MSC</a></li>
                    <li><a href="https://www.nexusmods.com/mysummercar/mods/8943">Pride Mod</a></li>
                </ul>
                <p>That's about all that happened.</p>
            </main>
            <Footer />
        </div>
        <script is:inline defer src="/scripts/background.js"></script>
    </body>
</html>
